",\"unit\":\"percent\"},\"relationship.revenue_share\":{\"definition\":\"指定客户/产品/地区收入占明确总收入分母的比例\",\"unit\":\"percent\"}}","prompt_sha256":"722ec9576e268c9b975764089eba9e21fd24dab5e3a91761c617e0da43700db8","question":"未来增长的主要驱动是否已被验证能从客户需求转为可持续利润，并扣除对存量业务、必要投入与股权融资的影响？","rubric_version":"2.0.0","scope":"entity","semantic_sha256":"36c87f138bc0f89163f3b1a133af90cad0d70a9186e3a9b6d62fdebac1cd96c3"},"subject_ref":{"analysis_subject_id":"ASJ_11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111","analysis_subject_revision":1,"entity_id":"ENT_1b2a4d3e-0000-4a1b-8c2d-000000000001","listing_id":null,"perimeter_sha256":"42b2c8411d22b2ac87cd0f3a5fef9fbc34f310103f28ef459c6d5c8752a17e15","primary_issuer_id":"ENT_1b2a4d3e-0000-4a1b-8c2d-000000000001","scope":"entity","scope_id":"ENT_1b2a4d3e-0000-4a1b-8c2d-000000000001","security_id":null,"segment_id":null}},"work_prompt_sha256":"722ec9576e268c9b975764089eba9e21fd24dab5e3a91761c617e0da43700db8"},"IQS_21":{"frozen_prompt_sha256":"9ebd9536a664e750368db2138869c08c193de7205fb976f403d25b59a186b76b","metadata":{"cohort":{"company_type":"unclassified","industries":[],"stage":"unclassified","subtype":null},"comparison_group_id":null,"construct_id":"IQS_21","cycle_sensitive":false,"entity_id":"ENT_1b2a4d3e-0000-4a1b-8c2d-000000000001","evidence_review_status":"unreviewed","field_id":"score.iqs_21","information_cutoff":"2026-10-10","inputset_id":"INPUT_SYNTHETIC","method_id":"module-locked-v1/core-constructs-v1/6fc872b1165fef41/56a542318c3d75a6","module_package_id":"pkg_b5a41d8c9f89adba8d57cce1792b1cac8db5378509996f6614472a691cfb5fba","module_release_id":"modrel_fc5de4a3dcce55866c8a2a83d82cdaa8caf8a3c59b6406d3a0ea75e7c9e01e74","question_definition_sha256":"8b02a0479dbc822ee1f8457d0bb85eb52e6526a42bfc4b43e9e7eeca52644f7a","question_id":"IQS_21","question_semantic_sha256":"56a542318c3d75a6f84a15bf08d948d1fad315763a70ac2b7a128e530d179d77","question_version":"2.0.0","run_id":"RUN_E2E","scan_id":"SCAN_E2E","schema_version":"1.1.0","scope":"entity","security_id":null,"segment_id":null,"task_mode":"primary","template_version":"3.2.0"},"subject_binding":{"identity_revision":1,"protocol":"stockqa.subject_context/1.0.0","question_contract":{"anchors":{"1":"新增投入回报不足，或增长带来的收益被存量利润损失、转型成本和融资摊薄抵消，持续毁损每股价值","10":"增量回报与再投资空间已有验证；扣除存量替代、转型投入和摊薄后，保守情形仍支持每股价值增长","5":"有可盈利机会，但增量回报、存量替代、融资条件或股东净效果仍受重要约束"},"comparison_role":"core","construct_id":"IQS_21","definition_sha256":"8b02a0479dbc822ee1f8457d0bb85eb52e6526a42bfc4b43e9e7eeca52644f7a","dimension":"growth","evidence":["增量而非历史资本回报","新批次经济性","存量业务被替代时损失的利润与资产退出成本","转型资本开支、营运资金、融资条件和股权摊薄","新增回报扣除上述代价后能否归属现有普通股东","人才与融资约束","饱和边界"],"id":"IQS_21","metric_contract":{"aggregation_role":"growth_core","critical_risk":false,"dimension":"growth","evidence_demands":{"counter_evidence_required":true,"require_durability_conditions":false,"require_net_economic_effect":true},"primary_metric_ref":"score.iqs_21","question_id":"IQS_21","replacement_for":null},"metric_id":"score.iqs_21","module_id":"common","priority":1,"prompt":"[IQS_21] 对象与口径={\"company\": \"Synthetic E2E issuer\", \"ticker\": \"ACME\", \"exchange\": \"XNAS\", \"as_of\": \"2026-10-10\", \"industry_modules\": [], \"cycle_position\": \"unknown\", \"recovery_review\": false, \"recovery_rationale\": \"\", \"entity_id\": \"ENT_1b2a4d3e-0000-4a1b-8c2d-000000000001\", \"security_id\": \"SEC_2c3b5e4f-0000-4b2c-9d3e-000000000001\"}\n新增资本在扣除存量业务被替代、转型投入和融资摊薄后，是否仍有吸引力的每股回报与足够再投资空间？\n证据关注：增量而非历史资本回报；新批次经济性；存量业务被替代时损失的利润与资产退出成本；转型资本开支、营运资金、融资条件和股权摊薄；新增回报扣除上述代价后能否归属现有普通股东；人才与融资约束；饱和边界\n评分锚点：1分=新增投入回报不足，或增长带来的收益被存量利润损失、转型成本和融资摊薄抵消，持续毁损每股价值；5分=有可盈利机会，但增量回报、存量替代、融资条件或股东净效果仍受重要约束；10分=增量回报与再投资空间已有验证；扣除存量替代、转型投入和摊薄后，保守情形仍支持每股价值增长。\n口径：分数衡量经济能力，不是行业内百分位；同业须同商业模式/阶段/期间/会计边界。；分别记录当前表现、已验证正常化能力、尚未兑现假设；亏损或低谷不自动否定壁垒，也不消除资金风险。；1/5/10锚点间给整数；8分需可核验多期或可比证据，高置信度不是高分；未知留空而非5。；评分与趋势分开：成熟稳固可高分，增长快但损毁价值仍低分。；分类待核实：只判断已确认的实体和问题，不套用未经证实的公司类型、行业或生命周期。\n\n实际联网搜索，仅用截止日前可得来源。不要下载公司文档。只输出符合下列schema的JSON；不使用score/description外层兼容包装。response_kind=score。事实不评分且score=null；未披露用insufficient_evidence，不等同不存在。已知部分可以answered+coverage.partial，并列缺项；关系和数值逐条绑定evidence_ids。canonical_entity_id/taxonomy_id只有已知主档映射才填，否则null，不自行创造。时间和模型由执行器另附，不在答案中自报执行回执。metrics使用明确单位、币种、期间和current/normalized/stress/forward口径；禁止混用。\n{\"$id\":\"urn:iqs:answer-content:1\",\"$schema\":\"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"basis\":{\"enum\":[\"current\",\"trailing\",\"normalized\",\"stress\",\"forward\",\"not_applicable\"]},\"confidence\":{\"enum\":[\"high\",\"medium\",\"low\"]},\"counterevidence\":{\"maxLength\":600,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"coverage\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"reason\":{\"maxLength\":350,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"status\":{\"enum\":[\"partial\",\"complete_for_scope\",\"unknown\",\"not_applicable\"]}},\"required\":[\"status\",\"reason\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"evidence\":{\"items\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"claim\":{\"maxLength\":400,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"id\":{\"maxLength\":60,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"published_at\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"format\":\"date\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"type\":\"null\"}]},\"title\":{\"maxLength\":200,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"url\":{\"format\":\"uri\",\"maxLength\":1800,\"pattern\":\"^https?://\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"id\",\"title\",\"url\",\"published_at\",\"claim\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"maxItems\":20,\"type\":\"array\"},\"information_as_of\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"format\":\"date\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"type\":\"null\"}]},\"items\":{\"items\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"aliases\":{\"items\":{\"maxLength\":100,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"maxItems\":8,\"type\":\"array\"},\"canonical_entity_id\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"maxLength\":120,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},{\"type\":\"null\"}]},\"commercial_stage\":{\"enum\":[\"research\",\"pilot\",\"qualified\",\"commercial\",\"discontinued\",\"unknown\",\"not_applicable\"]},\"confide